{"acceptance_length": 6.2631578947368425, "acceptance_lengths": [4, 4, 1, 4, 3, 2, 1, 2, 6, 13, 2, 8, 3, 1, 2, 5, 16, 16, 5, 8, 3, 5, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 15, 7, 16, 2, 3, 2, 1, 8, 12, 11, 11, 16, 7, 1, 2, 3, 5, 2, 8, 1, 7, 16, 16, 16, 3, 6, 13, 8, 16], "accepted_draft_lengths": [3, 3, 0, 3, 2, 1, 0, 1, 5, 12, 1, 7, 2, 0, 1, 4, 15, 15, 4, 7, 2, 4, 1, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 14, 6, 15, 1, 2, 1, 0, 7, 11, 10, 10, 15, 6, 0, 1, 2, 4, 1, 7, 0, 6, 15, 15, 15, 2, 5, 12, 7, 15], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 23447154176, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 23447136768, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "Let's break this down step by step.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 1: Time spent writing the song**\nCarol spends **4 hours** writing the song.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 2: Time spent recording the song**\nShe spends **half that much time** recording it.\n\n$$\n\\text{Recording time} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 4 = 2 \\text{ hours}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 3: Time spent editing the song**\nShe spends **90 minutes** editing it.\n\nWe need to convert this to **hours** to match the other times:\n\n$$\n90 \\text{ minutes} = \\frac{90}{60} = 1.5 \\text{ hours}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 4: Total work time**\nNow, add up all the times:\n\n$$\n\\text{Total time} = 4 \\text{ hours (writing)} + 2 \\text{ hours (recording)} + 1.5 \\text{ hours (editing)} = 7.5 \\text{ hours}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 5: Percentage of time spent editing**\nTo find the percentage of total time spent editing:\n\n$$\n\\text{Percentage} = \\left( \\frac{\\text{Editing time}}{\\text{Total time}} \\right) \\times 100 = \\left( \\frac{1.5}{7.5} \\right) \\times 100\n$$\n\n$$\n\\text{Percentage} = 0.2 \\times 100 = 20\\%\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n$$\n\\boxed{20\\%}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 2.0795743661001325, "draft_calls": 57, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 63, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "ece1269540becf19b73b75b0ca48a5dfd6178ffe372c6606870efbbab8ae580a", "method": "relay_base", "output_hash": "7ad8f100856169e14110957c